/original/exnFsbb9c3fDutTsgtJSWcDmZm0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two youngsters from rival New York City gangs fall in love, but tensions between their respective friends build toward tragedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1280,\"title\":\"3-Iron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hr8ghKbdo3UGUROYafpN38Sohfe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nqY8yuxLU4K9cSCQpsW4PGyotlN.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A drifter lives in people's houses while they are away and repays them by doing chores for them. His life changes when he meets a beautiful woman who wants to escape her unhappy marriage.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":152742,\"title\":\"The Best Offer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ibDGPgUZn6vxHiSgt2xeQyFp8Np.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4EdN5rIT43xcqi4IVRrhxiDOz6z.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Virgil Oldman is a world renowned antiques expert and auctioneer. An eccentric genius, he leads a solitary life, going to extreme lengths to keep his distance from the messiness of human relationships. When appointed by the beautiful but emotionally damaged Claire to oversee the valuation and sale of her family’s priceless art collection, Virgil allows himself to form an attachment to her – and soon he is engulfed by a passion which will rock his bland existence to the core.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1108566,\"title\":\"Killer Heat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/WiAEiqelck0NGWplhL5JQR12eg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6IsycwFwgZ0M1MIjXNkW9j45jcY.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An expat PI is hired to investigate a suspicious death in Crete, Greece, where jealousies run deep amongst the victim's powerful family.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4912,\"title\":\"Confessions of a Dangerous Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mM58ABMRzwn5zVx6BS7IiNK0j3F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uS03jRk64ZFFtpKNAhLppXa1nKP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Television made him famous, but his biggest hits happened off screen. Television producer by day, CIA assassin by night, Chuck Barris was recruited by the CIA at the height of his TV career and trained to become a covert operative. Or so Barris said.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":441393,\"title\":\"Ash Is Purest White\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l6UkF23uWkO25x7UEMnT0H4R5GR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLqkx8A6NoYfVf9EKHEOJf5ljxk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in China's underworld, this tale of love and betrayal follows a dancer who fired a gun to protect her mobster boyfriend during a fight. On release from prison 5 years later, she sets out to find him.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21461,\"title\":\"Lage Raho Munna Bhai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lgSn1tXDstMXSHJYkSibKkHqW8y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/urxONLFFBKFWzsxLcvUaRgo4v4M.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lovable goon Munna falls for a morning radio host by the name of Jahnvi, who also runs an elders' home which an unscrupulous builder seeks to attain. In order to gain Jahnvi’s attention, he cheats his way to winning a Mahatma Gandhi radio quiz. When Jahnvi consequently expresses interest in Munna, he and his best friend Circuit attempt to keep up the facade.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"G2cduBMs48o\"